# --- The shop's live data ----------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately not published. The stock sheet and the artifacts derived from it
# carry selling prices and MRPs, from which the shop's margins are trivially
# read; the media directory holds brand product photography whose rights sit with
# the brands, not with us. The code that produces all of it is here; the business
# data is not. Remove these lines if the shop decides otherwise.
*.xlsx
*.xls
nextjs/data/catalog/
nextjs/data/uploads/
nextjs/data/media/
nextjs/data/runs/

# --- OS noise ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*
